g at the four together.\n\nRESULT CF-011 | A1: Yes | A2: Yes | A3: No, not by itself | A4: Yes, weakly | A5: Yes | B1: No | B2: No | B3: Cannot tell | B4: Cannot tell | B5: No | B6: Yes"
